However, I later ran only anisotropic models separately, to estimate the anisotropy ratio, resulting in (ФR) = 2.1 (95% CI = 1.7-2.9). This ratio indicates quite a strong support for anisotropy, seemingly in conflict with the AIC results that ranked the isotropic models highest.

